{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47342","headline":"高士咏 楚狂接舆夫妻 · 吴筠","name":"高士咏 楚狂接舆夫妻","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"接舆耽冲玄，伉俪亦真逸。\n傲然辞徵聘，耕绩代禄秩。\n凤歌诫文宣，龙德遂隐密。\n一游峨嵋上，千载保灵术。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47342.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47342","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}